WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.060
Have you ever wondered what desires lie&nbsp;
inside the heart of an ordinary office chair?

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.660
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:13.820
to snap a picture of a blue swivel office chair&nbsp;
while it was positioned near and facing a corner.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.920
This was the result: "No change."

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.920
Huh. I guess regular chairs&nbsp;
don't want anything after all.

